{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "V. xxxi. — ΠΕΡΙ ΛΕΥΚΩΣΕΩΣ ΤΟΥ ΑΡΣΕΝΙΚΟΥ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΤΟΥ ΣΧΙΣΤΟΥ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Λαβὼν ἄρσενίχην, λείψον μετὰ ὄξους ἴσου καὶ ἀναλαβὼν, ἐπίθεε"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐπάνω χρησταχίδι φιάλην ἐπὶ φιάλην ἐπάνω περιπηλώσας, ἐλαφρῶ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πυρὶ ὑπόκαιε, ἄχρις ἂν ἴδῃς τὴν φιάλην γενομένην ... Καὶ ἄρας τὴν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "αἰθάλην, ποίησον ὡς κηρωτὴν μετὰ ὕδατος, καὶ κόλλησον τὴν φιάλην"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "χρησίμως γενομένην σὺν ἀριθμῷ ἕασον δὲ τὸ θεῖον ἄχρις ἂν λευκανθῇ,"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ὀπτήσον ἐν θερμοσποδιᾷ, ὡς ἄνω πρόκειται, καὶ ἔχε καὶ λαβὼν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "σανδαράχην, λειοτρίβησον μετὰ ὄξους βαλὼν εἰς β' ὥχας, βάλε εἰς"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "χλίβανον, καὶ ἄρας τὴν αἰθάλην, (f. 280 r.) ἔχε ἄρσενίχην καὶ σανδα-"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.20", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ράχην. Καὶ ἡ μαγνησία οὕτω πρῶτον λευκαίνεται ὡς ρῶν (sic), καὶ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-leukw-sews-tou-rsenikou-tou-sxistou-e-cod", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.21", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μετὰ ξανθοῦται."}
